['bridge',['如何得到 g？先复制 g=f，此时每格只含“一个位也没清”的数对。处理最低位 b=0 时，s=1（01）可以不清该位（原 g[1]=3），也可以清掉（g[0]=2），两类相加得到 5；s=3 从 1 加上 g[2]=3，得到 4。处理 b=1 时，g[3] 从 4 加上已经包含低位选择的 g[1]=5，得到 9。最终 g=[2,5,5,9]。','How do we build g? Start with g=f: each cell includes only the pair masks with no bits cleared. At the lowest bit b=0, s=1 (01) either keeps that bit (old g[1]=3) or clears it (g[0]=2), giving 5. Mask s=3 adds g[2]=3 to its old 1, giving 4. At b=1, g[3] adds g[1]=5, which already includes the low-bit choices, to its old 4, giving 9. Finally g=[2,5,5,9].']],
['proof',['为什么不会重复或遗漏？在每一轮开始时，g[s] 恰好汇总从 s 中任意清除已处理位、其余位不变的所有精确掩码频数。新位为 0 的 s 无需改变；新位为 1 的 s 分成“保留它”和“清掉它”两类，分别在旧 g[s] 与 g[s^flag] 中，两类互不相交。flag=1<<b 只标记本轮位。源掩码该位为 0，本轮不更新，因此原地相加安全。处理全部 B 位后，所有且仅有子掩码已被计入。每个合法三元组属于唯一的 k 和唯一的数对掩码，所以最终相加恰好计数一次。','Why is nothing duplicated or missed? At the start of each round, g[s] sums exact pair frequencies obtained by clearing any processed bits of s while leaving all other bits unchanged. Masks with the new bit 0 stay unchanged. Those with it 1 split into disjoint keep-it and clear-it families, held in old g[s] and g[s^flag]. Here flag=1<<b marks this round’s bit. The source mask has that bit 0 and is not updated this round, so in-place addition is safe. After all B bits, exactly all submasks are included. Each valid triple has a unique k and pair mask, so the final sum counts it once.']],
